**Status:** OPTIONAL - Suggested maintenance

---

## Current Workspace State

```
__DEBUG__/training_failures/
├── scripts/           # 11 files (9 original + 2 new diagnostic scripts)
├── logs/              # 21 files (18 old + 3 new test logs)
├── reports/           # 6 reports
├── implementations/   # 102 items (baudm_parseq clone)
├── findings/          # 5 documents
