## Recommended Actions

### 1. Keep Useful Diagnostic Scripts ✅
**These are valuable for future debugging:**
- [scripts/test_cuda_environment.py](file:///workspaces/__DEBUG__/training_failures/scripts/test_cuda_environment.py) - Environment diagnostic
- [scripts/test_dataloader_workers.py](file:///workspaces/__DEBUG__/training_failures/scripts/test_dataloader_workers.py) - DataLoader test framework

**Action:** None needed - keep these

### 2. Archive Old Test Logs
**Consolidate old logs:**
```bash
cd __DEBUG__/training_failures/

# Create dated archive
mkdir -p .archive/logs_pre_spawn_fix_2026-02-08

# Move old run logs (keep new diagnostic/test logs)
mv logs/run30.log logs/run34.log logs/run35.log logs/run36.log \
   logs/run37.log logs/run38.log logs/run39.log logs/run40.log \
   logs/run41.log logs/run42.log logs/run43.log logs/run44.log \
   logs/run45_*.log logs/run46_*.log logs/run47_*.log logs/run48_*.log \
   .archive/logs_pre_spawn_fix_2026-02-08/

# Keep new diagnostic logs in logs/
# - env_diagnostic_*.log
# - dataloader_test_*.log  
# - test_spawn_workers*.log
# - run_current_test_*.log
```

### 3. Consolidate Archive Directories
**Fix multiple archive dirs:**
```bash
cd __DEBUG__/training_failures/

# Consolidate into .archive/
mv __archvie__/* .archive/ 2>/dev/null || true
mv archive/* .archive/ 2>/dev/null || true

# Remove empty duplicates
rmdir __archvie__ archive 2>/dev/null || true
```

### 4. Document baudm_parseq Reference
**Large implementations/ directory:**

Option A: Keep as-is (reference code)
- Useful for comparing implementations
- Size: ~102 items but mostly text files

Option B: Document and remove
```bash
# Document the clone
echo "Reference: baudm/parseq official implementation" > implementations/README.md
echo "Cloned from: https://github.com/baudm/parseq" >> implementations/README.md
echo "Date: 2026-02-08" >> implementations/README.md
echo "Note: Our adapter in ocr/domains/recognition/models/parseq_official_adapter.py" >> implementations/README.md

# Optional: Remove if space is concern
# rm -rf implementations/baudm_parseq/
```

**Recommendation:** Keep for now, useful reference

### 5. Update Debugging Index
**Update INDEX.md with latest session info:**
```bash
# Edit __DEBUG__/training_failures/INDEX.md
# Add:
# - session_handover_2026-02-08_2256.md - Initial investigation
# - Brain artifacts from conversation 4e7f4c2a-5a1b-4830-a69c-3e2869d06e9f
```

